I decided to try btrfs on F13 (2.6.33.6-147.2.4.fc13.x86_64 kernel) with the 
following fs_mark command and a 1.5 TB Seagate S-ATA disk:

# fs_mark -s 0 -S 0 -D 1000 -n 1000000 -L 1000 -d /test/ -l btrfs_log.txt

